# 051 · Pareto champions and population search

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [later](../roadmap.md#later)

## What

Keep several best results that trade one metric for another, and let a campaign evolve a population in place of one champion.

## Why

Many real goals trade speed against memory, size or accuracy.

## Done when

- [ ] A campaign keeps a Pareto set, and the dashboard shows it.

